Well, now hold on Mr. Primm.

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:30.020
Now, Heart said they Karen eats insects

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:32.120
or leafy green vegetables.

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:32.690
Or.

